**Refining load-more button behavior**

I’m working out the exact markup and timing for the Load More button, managing action timeouts and intervals to 
prevent premature clicks. The button disables while loading older content based on page cursors, then disappears when 
no more pages remain. I’m balancing flakiness on slow CI with correct timeouts and adjusting approval rules to allow 
Low severity issues but reject Medium/High without triggering “needs revision.”
